{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583230/extras/8leve.jpg?t=1744578268\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Etheriia - Chapter - DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The interdimensional journey of <i>Etheriia - Travelogue</i> is about to begin! After months of development, <strong>Chapter 1</strong> <strong>- DEMO</strong> is out for free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c An adventure full of mystery, sensuality and interdimensional challenges <br>\ud83d\udd0d A preview of the <strong>Complete Edition</strong>, scheduled for September 2026 <br>\ud83c\udfad Outstanding characters and an engaging story</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why are we launching the free demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We want as many players as possible to explore this universe and help us shape the next chapters with feedback and suggestions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Complete Edition is coming soon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc5 F <strong>ull release: September 2026</strong> <br>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Anyone who downloads the demo will get a <strong>special discount</strong> on the final version</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Support the project and unlock exclusive content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to help the development, you can support and get <strong>early access to exclusive scenes and content</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Add it to your wishlist and get ready for the journey!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demo Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583230/749e46e04d36d7a1ce4671f4ffc1678ef62c8fc4.jpg"},{"name":"Exclusive Etheriia Community","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583230/5b82781d7a5f5